      "CostumeUniqueId": 1900905201,
      "EventContentId": 860,
      "VoiceCondition": "WinTurn",
      "AnimationName": "01",
      "Duration": 2050,
      "LocalizeKR": "이것이 아비도스\n의 저력입니다!",
      "LocalizeJP": "これがアビドスの\n本気です！",
      "LocalizeTH": "นี่คือพลังที่แท้จริง\nของอะบิดอสค่ะ!",
      "LocalizeTW": "這就是阿拜多斯的\n真本事！",
      "LocalizeEN": "This is the true strength of Abydos!",
      "VoiceId": 287323843
    },
    {
      "Id": 86010102,
      "CharacterId": 860101,
      "CostumeUniqueId": 1900905201,
      "EventContentId": 860,
      "VoiceCondition": "WinTurn",
      "AnimationName": "03",
      "Duration": 2250,
      "LocalizeKR": "후방 지원은\n특기니까요!",
      "LocalizeJP": "後方支援は\n得意ですので！",
      "LocalizeTH": "เรื่องสนับสนุนแนวหลัง\nฉันถนัดอยู่แล้วค่ะ!",
      "LocalizeTW": "後方支援\n是我的專長！",
      "LocalizeEN": "Rear support is my expertise!",
      "VoiceId": 2229848235
    },
    {
      "Id": 86010103,
      "CharacterId": 860101,
      "CostumeUniqueId": 1900905201,
      "EventContentId": 860,
      "VoiceCondition": "LoseTurn",
      "AnimationName": "09",
      "Duration": 4150,
      "LocalizeKR": "아앗! 가재 씨!\n괜찮으세요?!",
      "LocalizeJP": "ざ、ザリガニさん\n…大丈夫ですか？",
      "LocalizeTH": "อ๊ะ! คุณเครย์ฟิช!\nเป็นอะไรรึเปล่าคะ?!",
      "LocalizeTW": "螯，螯蝦先生\n…你還好嗎？",
      "LocalizeEN": "Ah! Mr. Crayfish! Are you okay?!",
      "VoiceId": 745381193
    },
    {
      "Id": 86010104,
      "CharacterId": 860101,
      "CostumeUniqueId": 1900905201,
      "EventContentId": 860,
      "VoiceCondition": "LoseTurn",
      "AnimationName": "11",
      "Duration": 2000,
      "LocalizeKR": "어, 어,\n어쩌지…!",
      "LocalizeJP": "ど、どう\nしましょう！？",
      "LocalizeTH": "ทะ... ทำยังไงดี...?!",
      "LocalizeTW": "怎，怎麼\n辦才好！？",
      "LocalizeEN": "Wh-What should I do...?!",
      "VoiceId": 2383690282
    },
